{"overview":"«رایلند گریس»، معلم علوم، در یک فضاپیما در فاصله چند سال نوری از خانه بیدار می‌شود، در حالی که هیچ خاطری از اینکه کیست و چطور به آنجا آمده ندارد. با بازگشت حافظه‌اش، او شروع به کشف مأموریت خود می‌کند: حل معما و راز ماده اسرارآمیزی که باعث خاموش شدن خورشید شده است. او باید برای نجات تمام موجودات زمین از انقراض، به دانش علمی و ایده‌های غیرمتعارف خود متکی شود.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Science teacher Ryland Grace wakes up on a spaceship light years from home with no recollection of who he is or how he got there. As his memory returns, he begins to uncover his mission: solve the riddle of the mysterious substance causing the sun to die out. He must call on his scientific knowledge and unorthodox ideas to save everything on Earth from extinction.","tagline_en":"Believe in the Hail Mary.","runtime":157,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["Phil Lord","Christopher Miller"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"رایان گاسلینگ","role":"Ryland Grace","photo":"/lyUyVARQKhGxaxy0FbPJCQRpiaW.jpg","en":"Ryan Gosling"},{"name":"Sandra Hüller","role":"Eva Stratt","photo":"/jQfKXVCPTH9KEnzHHU4QemCnlMe.jpg"},{"name":"James Ortiz","role":"Rocky (voice)","photo":"/unzBwVsoq8rAH8BAYlPR1zsWQ4E.jpg"},{"name":"Lionel Boyce","role":"Carl","photo":"/hpIxX5nkfA3pWCW8rYkEUCSBVyS.jpg"},{"name":"Milana Vayntrub","role":"Olesya Ilyukhina","photo":"/i5Cou9ExwTZvRRtl79V75CsI7oC.jpg"},{"name":"کن لئونگ","role":"Yao","photo":"/hpatUP6u74gkpDRmn9voNY9V43O.jpg","en":"Ken Leung"},{"name":"Priya Kansara","role":"Mary (voice)","photo":"/zv9kpaQ8AVBfjI2LAAZV58NeVQg.jpg"},{"name":"Mia Soteriou","role":"Dr. Browne","photo":"/bU4Twfk4as290gPFouByj7Wjd2.jpg"},{"name":"Annelle Olaleye","role":"Olivia","photo":"/V0UqW30EQaHjGhwDnb6dT0AWmz.jpg"},{"name":"Maya Eva Hosein","role":"Rekha","photo":"/lDHbsnyUoBzmtbMevNl4F2n8B8B.jpg"},{"name":"Bastian Antonio Fuentes","role":"Parker","photo":"/u7SDAocZ7ZCMOCejLRZtZFdb2Bl.jpg"},{"name":"Alice Brittain","role":"Hardware Store